        "h_title": "With a rich beef broth intensified by a splash of fresh cow’s blood, boat noodles are some of the most flavoursome of all Thai noodle soups, yet curiously scarce from most Thai restaurant menus. We delve into the history of these bowls, traditionally served from canoes gliding along the Kingdom’s canals.",
